%% Figure 13 / Chapter Figure 4.10 - Committee Review Activity Diagram
flowchart LR
    Start([Start]):::terminal
    Queue["Open committee queue"]:::process
    Select["Select eligible verified application"]:::process
    History["Review HOD/Dean comments and HR verification history"]:::process
    Evidence["Inspect verified evidence and eligibility report"]:::process
    Conflict{"Conflict of interest?"}:::decision
    Recuse["Recuse outside current system workflow"]:::exception
    Recommend["Enter recommendation and justification"]:::process
    Decision{"Recommendation"}:::decision
    Further["Request further review"]:::exception
    NotRec["Record NOT_RECOMMENDED"]:::exception
    Rec["Record RECOMMENDED"]:::process
    Audit["Save ReviewComment, StatusHistory, AuditLog, and HR notification"]:::audit
    End([End]):::terminal

    Start --> Queue --> Select --> History --> Evidence --> Conflict
    Conflict -- Yes --> Recuse --> End
    Conflict -- No --> Recommend --> Decision
    Decision -- Further review --> Further --> Audit
    Decision -- Not recommended --> NotRec --> Audit
    Decision -- Recommended --> Rec --> Audit
    Audit --> End

